    "semanticRules": [
      "`on_deck_package_id=SHA-256(JCS({schema:\"libra.on-deck-package-id@1\",libraRunId,packageRevision}))`，只作为由Run内唯一revision预派生的稳定身份",
      "`package_digest`必须由完整`OnDeckProductPackage@1`按8.6.19公式重建，不能使用自选字段子集",
      "`published_at_ms`是commit metadata且不进入该content digest",
      "`offer_id=SHA-256(JCS({schema:\"libra.product-offer-id@1\",onDeckPackageId,packageDigest}))`且唯一",
      "run state pair逐字节引用immutable Run revision",
      "四个manifest ID按8.6.21由run/package revision和manifest kind唯一派生",
      "`related_disposition_set_digest`必须从Off-load Context逐项source-to-final mapping重建并精确覆盖Run Basis的Related Disposition Scope",
      "任何遗漏、重复或role不一致禁止Promotion",
      "typed JSON各≤`64 KiB`",
      "`promotion_decision_digest`与Run/Workspace/Control/derived authority historical rows重建值逐字节一致",
      "`UNIQUE(libra_run_id,package_revision)`及`UNIQUE(libra_run_id,package_digest)`",
      "Package row append-only，accepted/rejected终态只由`libra_delivery_receipts`表达",
      "`INDEX(shelf_id,state,published_at_ms)`"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`on_deck_package_id PK, offer_id, package_revision, libra_run_id FK, run_state_revision, run_state_digest, subject_id FK, shelf_id, acceptance_spec_id FK, acceptance_spec_record_digest, resolved_identity_fact_id, resolved_identity_revision, resolved_identity_digest, product_structure_schema_ref, product_structure_json, product_structure_digest, run_material_manifest_id FK, run_material_manifest_digest, product_material_manifest_id, product_material_manifest_digest, product_fact_manifest_id, product_fact_set_digest, product_fact_manifest_digest, artifact_manifest_id, artifact_manifest_digest, media_cast_fact_id, media_cast_fact_digest, offload_context_manifest_id, offload_context_digest, related_disposition_set_digest, production_provenance_schema_ref, production_provenance_json, production_provenance_digest, attestation_schema_ref, attestation_json, attestation_digest, promotion_decision_digest, package_digest, state(published), published_at_ms`",
      "constraints": "`on_deck_package_id=SHA-256(JCS({schema:\"libra.on-deck-package-id@1\",libraRunId,packageRevision}))`，只作为由Run内唯一revision预派生的稳定身份；`package_digest`必须由完整`OnDeckProductPackage@1`按8.6.19公式重建，不能使用自选字段子集；`published_at_ms`是commit metadata且不进入该content digest；`offer_id=SHA-256(JCS({schema:\"libra.product-offer-id@1\",onDeckPackageId,packageDigest}))`且唯一；run state pair逐字节引用immutable Run revision；四个manifest ID按8.6.21由run/package revision和manifest kind唯一派生；`related_disposition_set_digest`必须从Off-load Context逐项source-to-final mapping重建并精确覆盖Run Basis的Related Disposition Scope；任何遗漏、重复或role不一致禁止Promotion；typed JSON各≤`64 KiB`；`promotion_decision_digest`与Run/Workspace/Control/derived authority historical rows重建值逐字节一致；`UNIQUE(libra_run_id,package_revision)`及`UNIQUE(libra_run_id,package_digest)`；Package row append-only，accepted/rejected终态只由`libra_delivery_receipts`表达；`INDEX(shelf_id,state,published_at_ms)`"
    },
